#
# This file contains the list of repositories that are used
# by the './zenircd module' command.
# Note that 3rd party modules are NOT written by the ZenIRCd team.
# Use such modules at your own risk. In case of problems, contact
# the module author.
#

#
# ZenIRCd does not ship UnrealIRCd's module index by default.
# There is no Zen-owned equivalent yet. Admins may uncomment the
# Unreal list below at their own risk, or add a Zen-owned list later.
# All URLs MUST start with https://
#
# https://modules.unrealircd.org/modules.list

# You can add more repositories here. However, do note that all
# URLs MUST start with https://
